# Runner build output and run results are artifacts, not source.
#
# `results/` carries no leading slash, so it matches at any depth: the JS and
# Python runners write runners/results/, the Java one writes
# runners/java/results/, and only the second path was named here — leaving
# ~1.2 MB of verdicts committable, against a manifest sha256 they no longer
# matched. A committed .verdicts file is a frozen baseline nobody froze on
# purpose; the reviewed one lives in conformance/run-all.sh.
java/.build/
results/
